    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the exciting new game &quot;Poor  Piggy Pirate&quot;</strong> you steer your adorable piggy buccaneer (and other pets) through dangerous waters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the fierce bunny pirates and other dangers along the way. And of course: collect as much yummy fruit as possible to earn the highscore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Poor Pirate Piggy&quot; is a cute retro pixelart adventure for the whole family!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc37 adorable retro pixel graphics<br>\ud83c\udfdd randomly generated levels with islands, rocks, seamines and other dangers<br>\u2694\ufe0f fun fast-paced gameplay<br>\ud83d\udc7e loads of enemy types<br>\ud83c\udf49 several kinds of fruit to collect<br>\ud83d\udc3e unlock dozens of cute little animals to play as!</p>",
